spot before you pick it. Your plane is thrown a moment after you arrive - no button to press. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46288220/","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T07:27:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114035288","verified_at":"2026-10-23T11:26:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2765870-1846651706690276","game_id":"steam-2765870","kind":"update","title":"Demo update: edit your tracks and see where you're flying","summary":"This demo update adds a simple way to edit your Race tracks, plus camera and performance improvements. Edit your Race tracks Open Edit Track after recording, from your own Race track's Details, or after finishing one of your tracks. Move along the recorded route and add Simple hoops in three sizes: 5, 15 or 30 metres. Adding a hoop moves the cursor 2 metres forward for the next one. Remove the closest Simple hoop, or rename the track. To move or resize an existing hoop, remove it and add it agai","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T13:39:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690276","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2765870-1846651706683016","game_id":"steam-2765870","kind":"update","title":"Demo update: track ghosts, a Yours tab and new controls","summary":"A bigger update for the demo is now live, based on the first day of playtesting. What's new Glide, Balloons and Close Calls tracks now fly their best runs with you. On Glide and Close Calls you race the top 3 plus your own best; on Balloons the leader shows you the route. New default controls: split sticks (roll on the left stick, pitch on the right) and inverted pitch (pull back to climb). Prefer the old way? Change it in Set